# Files in this repo that must never be part of a deployment.
#
# Everything listed here was previously served publicly at 200. The
# _build/bodies/*.html files were the worst of it: 20 unstyled, title-less,
# navigation-free pages carrying a byte-for-byte copy of every article's text,
# which reads to a crawler as duplicate, low-value content.

# Build sources: article bodies, metadata, image manifests, PowerShell build
# and check scripts, scratch candidate JSON.
_build/

# One-off patch scripts used to edit the static HTML in place.
*.py

# Apache config. Inert here (this site is on Vercel) and superseded by
# vercel.json. Kept in the repo for reference only.
.htaccess

# Editor / tooling scratch.
.mimocode/
